description: Next.js frontend conventions for Safnom
globs: frontend/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Frontend

- App Router under `frontend/app/`.
- Use Tailwind for styling.
- Call the backend only through `frontend/services/api.ts` (base URL from `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`).
- Shared API types in `frontend/types/`.
- Do not hardcode `http://localhost:5000` in components.
